Iroh
====
Iroh is a fork of VulkanMod, used under the GNU Lesser General Public License v3.0.

Base: VulkanMod, Copyright (c) xCollateral and contributors
      https://github.com/xCollateral/VulkanMod
      Forked from tag 0.5.5 (commit f23855f2675f1efb52fb8aa2c26bc23dccfb5543), Minecraft 1.21.1.
      Upstream Java packages (net.vulkanmod.*) are kept so upstream changes merge cleanly.
      New Iroh code lives under dev.elemore.iroh.

The full licence text is in LICENSE. Files copied from other projects are listed below
with their source and licence, added in the same commit that copies them.

AMD FidelityFX SDK v1.1.4 (MIT), compiled into the optional native library iroh-native/ (libiroh_fsr): see THIRD_PARTY.md
  for the licence text, the pinned commit and the modifications (iroh-native/fsr/patches/ffx-1.1.4-iroh.patch). The SDK
  source is not copied into this repository; iroh-native/fsr/fetch-sdk.sh downloads it by commit and content hash.

Vitrail-Shaders (LGPL-3.0-only), https://github.com/avpbynf/Vitrail-Shaders (reference clone reference/Vitrail-Shaders, commit 7a3cdcb)
  src/main/java/dev/elemore/iroh/shaderpack/ProgramSet.java: the program fallback parent map follows
  Vitrail's common/src/main/java/dev/vitrail/pack/model/ProgramFallbacks.java, which Vitrail's NOTICE
  lists as derived from Iris (https://github.com/IrisShaders/Iris, LGPL-3.0, copyright the Iris
  contributors). Re-typed as a table; no other Vitrail or Iris code is copied.

NVIDIA NRD v4.18.0 (NVIDIA RTX SDKs licence, proprietary): only built locally on request (iroh-native/build-nrd.sh) and never bundled in
  this repository or the default jar. See THIRD_PARTY.md for what a redistributor of the built component must add. No NVIDIA source is
  distributed by this project.

Upstream VulkanMod changes after the fork point (LGPL-3.0, same project, xCollateral and contributors), back-ported by
